msgid "Instagram needs to be reconnected: the stored access token can no longer be read. This happens when the site’s security keys change or the database is moved to another site. Connect with Instagram or enter a new access token."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/InstagramCredentials.php:253
msgid "The Instagram access token could not be stored encrypted, so the previous token was kept. Try again."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/settings/InstagramTab.js:476
msgid "Or disconnect to remove the unreadable token from this site."
msgstr ""
